},{"id":"anomaly_failure.4158","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"特殊项目失败","en":"Special Project Failed"},"texts":[{"zh":"打开[WarriorHomePlanet.GetName]上发现的容器后，我们才意识到那是一个生物武器的发射器。\n\n这种生物武器专门降低目标的生殖能力，并且扩散迅速。不过和我们的遗传因子不兼容，所以不会影响我们种群的数量。","en":"After opening the container we found on [WarriorHomePlanet.GetName] we were shocked to realize that it was a dispenser for a biological weapon!\n\nThe bio-weapon was made to target fertility functions and quickly spreads. It is however not entirely compatible with our DNA, and will not cause us to diminish in numbers."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8d5475edf8f6f84b714c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURSES","label":{"zh":"可恶！","en":"Curses!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"你的帝国获得抑制繁衍生物武器的修正。","en":"Your Empire gains the Fertility Inhibiting Bio-Weapon modifier."}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"clears":["cryo_pod_planet"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/failures.txt","line":424},"names":{"WarriorHomePlanet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"anomaly_failure.4156","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"特殊项目失败","en":"Special Project Failed"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[WarriorHomePlanet.GetName]的地下避难所附近清除野兽时，战斗意外地导致了建筑崩塌。我们未能从残骸中回收到有价值的东西。","en":"Fighting off the beasts around the underground vault on [WarriorHomePlanet.GetName] has caused the complex to collapse. We are unable to salvage anything of value from the debris."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8d5475edf8f6f84b714c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"UNFORTUNATE","label":{"zh":"真不幸。","en":"Unfortunate."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"clears":["cryo_pod_planet"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/failures.txt","line":351},"names":{"WarriorHomePlanet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}}]}